      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c872970a4264c0cacf21aaa|full_name}: I've suggested this to people in-game while complaining about it, but it could also be a toggle for preferred hand. It's however they decide to go about it, realistically. The last-used-trigger suggestion is definitely more elegant, though.",
