  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-10T00:22:20.680Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I am a lefty. I pull up the menu on my right hand so I can aim with my left and navigate with it. It's beyond jarring when I have to suddenly aim with the right hand, when I was consciously using the left hand.\n\n\nWe need a left handed option for portal placement. Also, thank you for adding this feature!",
